{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1108595-play-by-post-what-lurks-beneath-the-waves-ic-thread","id":1108595,"title":"[Play By Post] What Lurks Beneath The Waves IC Thread","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play","Play by Post"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-06-27T19:25:55-07:00","id":1108595,"title":"[Play By Post] What Lurks Beneath The Waves IC Thread","content":"To be on the sea for five weeks could be maddening, but a peaceful five weeks without any sightings of Fair Folk raiders is far more preferable than an &quot;exciting&quot; fate should one fall into the Rakshas' clutches.<br /> <br /> The sound of the <i>sanxian</i> playing during the voyage so far provided by the VIP on board, Brilliant Snow Crow, is the only thing that breaks up the monotony of the trip. As the ship moves midway through the Dreaming Sea, normally considered the most dangerous portion of the trip, Brilliant Snow Crow's performance becomes softer, as if trying to calm the passengers and crew while trying to minimize his volume.<br /> <br /> Another thing to be thankful for is the weather, which is quite windy but generally calm, and the clouds provide some measure of shade without colliding with each other enough to gather into storm clouds, enabling this trip to remain smooth and swift. And it is at this midway point where Haven's assigned escort ship, The Spry Mollusk, will accompany the merchant's vessel for the remainder of the journey.<br /> <br /> Brilliant Snow Crow is a handsome young man with snow white hair and well-tailored blue silk clothes. He has a <i>sanxian</i> made from fine antique wood with blue jade parts and silvery strings. He is also never seen without a solid blue jade smoking pipe with delicate wires wrapped around the luxury item. He is friendly to the rest of the passengers and often hosts feasts on the deck of the luxury vessel for all passengers at his expense, making use of the mingling sessions to talk to each passenger and ask for their life stories, which under the influence of good food and wine, the passengers are all too willing to tell. He has a bodyguard who is very quiet and keeps to himself, preferring to stay in a quiet corner with line of sight to his charge and remain still, till the point where one could mistake him for a statue. When probed about his name, he will simply reply &quot;Strong Oak&quot; and resumes his watch and end the conversation. The only time the man is seen talking is when he is privately conferring with Brilliant Snow Crow, exuding a sort of aura that makes it very clear that his conversation with his employers is private and nobody should get close.<br /> <br /> In the morning, when the two ships meet in the open sea the collective passengers held their breath as they behold the gossamer fittings and decorations on The Spry Mollusk, but it is only when the captain and crew wave the flag of Haven that a collective sigh of relief washes over the deck, with some small cheers.<br /> <br /> OOC: Decide for 5 weeks what your characters will do prior to meeting with The Spry Mollusk.<br /> <br /> Hope's Last Gasp<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Your sifu has given you a small bag of silver as travelling expenses and suggested that Haven might have some allies you can recruit for your personal mission, but also with strong suggestion that you get stronger yourself before embarking on your quest. You bought yourself a ticket and boarded the ship. Decide if you would tell Brilliant Snow Owl your actual life story or whether you'll make something up.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Mirrin<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">You had been venturing around the Scavenger lands for a few months when one day, waking up from your camp site you find a tree spirit that tells you that it has received a message requesting you make your way to Haven and provides you the directions and a ticket onto a luxury vessel. If you try to investigate, all you will be told is that it at the behest of a few powerful gods that request your presence in Haven. Decide if you will tell Brilliant Snow Crow your actual life story or whether you will make a story up.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Paxrae<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">The Spry Mollusk is obviously a fae ship, with all the hardened gossamer fittings and decorations that are attached to a sturdy wooden frame.<br /> <br /> Brilliant Snow Crow is the mayor's son who has returned from the Realm after graduating from secondary school. His father, Austere White Crane does not claim descent or lineage from any of the Realm's Great House but his recent immigration to Haven about a hundred years ago does seem to suggest someone wealthy enough to uproot himself and his family and move all the way to the edge of Creation to be an easy thing to do. You and your crew and ship are dispatched to escort the mayor's son back to Haven safely.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":13507,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13507-nicklance","user":"NickLance","date":". 06-27-2017, 10:28 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13507-nicklance","name":"NickLance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13507_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-27T20:51:57-07:00","id":1108613,"title":"","content":"These last five weeks leading up to the meeting with Brilliant Snow Crow's return voyage have been a boon of peace, giving Paxrae and his crew more time to accustom themselves to the Spry Mollusk. It's a bit larger than his last vessel, but no slower for it. Once Murder at Sea (Paxrae's first mate has a very morbid sense of humor, naming their crew such) has learned the quirks and peculiarities of her, she'll be the preeminent force on Haven's share of the Dreaming Sea.<br /> <br /> &quot;Good Tides!&quot; Paxrae exclaims jovially form his vantage at the bow. &quot;I, Captain Paxrae and the Spry Mollusk are at your service. I believe you're awaiting an escort to Haven? Well then be at ease, it has arrived!&quot; Paxrae delivers an elaborate bow and awaits permission to board from the merchant vessel, as is only proper, to discuss the escort protocols with the captain.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3976-silent-witness","name":"Silent Witness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3976_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"138"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-28T05:17:42-07:00","id":1108713,"title":"","content":"While many bemoan the prospect of 5 weeks at sea, Mirrin's eyes shine with a childlike brightness at the prospect of new sights, new seas, and new stories. During the day the youngster can be found exploring hidden nooks and hideaways of the strange, dreaming ship, and can often be found clambered halfway up a mast or rigging, looking eagerly out to the horizons, or trying to catch a glimpse of things drifting beneath the surface of the sea.<br /> <br /> In the evenings Mirrin sits and listens to songs and stories as as the young nobleman talks with the passengers. When Brilliant Snow Crow turns his attention to Mirrin - knowing that the best lies are woven from threads of truth - Mirrin tells of childhood poverty in Nexus, of serving middling lords of the streets to survive, and of finding service and use to other, more powerful figures as a messenger to whom most turned a blind eye in the streets of a big city. When pressed on the journey to Haven, Mirrin says that there are enough bad memories and nightmares of dark city streets and that it was time to explore the wilder parts of the world. A ticket on the ship was the price of a service performed for someone of means, who suggested that Mirrin's talents might lead to adventure or employment in town's like Haven. So here we are...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Visit me at <a href=\"http://www.bragrman.com\" target=\"_blank\"><i>Tales of Grey</i></a> - my RPG Game-Master's blog.<br /> <br /> &quot;If only I had an enemy bigger than my apathy, I could have won&quot; - <i>I gave you all,</i> Mumford &amp; Sons","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8520-capitantypo","name":"CapitanTypo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8520_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"896"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-28T06:00:16-07:00","id":1108722,"title":"","content":"On the boat, there is a child. She is no more than 9 years old, but from the chalk white skin and blood red lips, it is clear she grew up in a shadowland. She is a quiet girl, any sound her movements make swallowed up by the noises of a ship at sea. In fact, her cat is often more noticable than her. <br /> <br /> If asked about her past, she makes no secret that she is an escaped prisoner of a deathlord, and that the soulsteel cutlery she uses to eat are, in fact, her family. Whenever such topics come up, she hugs her cat, Mr Fluffy (who is a girl), and it purrs and licks her to give her comfort.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-28T17:44:32-07:00","id":1109052,"title":"","content":"The formalities with the escort is pretty simple. The cruise ship will continue its course towards Haven while The Spry Mollusk will take the lead as the escort. The captain of this cruise ship named The Gleaming Pearl, Steadfast Turtle, is not as good a mood because a large sum of money was paid for him to cut through the Dreaming Sea rather than his usual route of circling around the coast making port of calls along the way. But since the money is really good he decided to take the risk and move into more unknown (and therefore dangerous) waters. Brilliant Snow Crow gives a grateful smile and nod at Pazrae as he boards the cruise ship letting the two captains do their work uninterrupted as he continues to mingle with the guests.<br /> <br /> Upon hearing Mirrin's story, Brilliant Snow Crow gives a very sympathetic nod, and shows his ability to relate by recounting the cutthroat political plays that even secondary school students engage with each other before they graduate, how disgusting that the lap of luxury blinds people to the problems of the people and how the Immaculate Philosophy practically abuses those not blessed by the Dragons, giving a very clear indication to the other passengers that this young man, with all the markings of the Air-Blessed, is just like them, too far away from the dogmatic Immaculates to be overly influenced by their dogma. He also congratulates Mirrin on being so brave to take the first step into the bigger world, and laments that not many of his fellow kin have the maturity to do the same.<br /> <br /> Perhaps also a testatment to Hope's easily over-looked presence. Few if any was within earshot when she recounts her life story. Brilliant Snow Crow listens intently, giving her his undivided attention, face reflecting the pain as she recounts the circumstances that befell her family even if her face does not show it, the body language and reaction of her cat speaks volumes. <br /> <br /> A week into the voyage after meeting up with The Spry Mollusk, the mists that coil and roll over the surface of the Dreaming Sea seems to have pulled back a little more, revealing a never-before-seen island several miles away, pretty large, with a tall single mountain jutting out from the center of it, capped entirely in ice. Brilliant Snow Crow takes a few moments to look at the island with a small frown, looking at his map. &quot;This is very strange. According to this map, this island wasn't here. Then again it seems that the borders of the Dreaming Sea just got pushed back several miles more as well.&quot;<br /> <br /> OOC: Perception + Awareness for everyone. Post your results on the OOC thread.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13507-nicklance","name":"NickLance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13507_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-29T06:39:33-07:00","id":1109215,"title":"","content":"Paxrae could see the island vaguely, as he strains against the mists, it certainly wasn't in the charts, his excellent memory of sea routes didn't fail him. And he spots from the other side of a ship a black speck that approaches them.<br /> <br /> Hope on the other hand feels something chilling running up her spine very very subtly as her gaze lays on the mountain that juts out from the island, and as she moves her view away to the other side of the ship, she seems to spot a black-colored ship moving towards them.<br /> <br /> Mirrin does not notice anything, and presumably joins the others is just looking at the new island, together with Brilliant Snow Crow.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13507-nicklance","name":"NickLance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13507_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-29T11:23:59-07:00","id":1109332,"title":"","content":"&quot;What's that?&quot; Hope exclaims as she points to the black ship. &quot;It looks like a ship!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-29T14:38:13-07:00","id":1109404,"title":"","content":"Brilliant Snow Crow looks at where Hope is pointing and sighs. &quot;It looks like The Spry Mollusk is required to battle. Those who cannot fight, please hide below deck!&quot; he shouts as the deck quickly empties, but he remains on deck.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13507-nicklance","name":"NickLance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13507_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-29T15:37:49-07:00","id":1109436,"title":"","content":"Hope's Last Gasp, interestingly enough, doesn't leave the deck. She merely turns to Brilliant Snow Crow.<br /> <br /> &quot;What is it?&quot; She asks curiously.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-29T16:55:50-07:00","id":1109476,"title":"","content":"Brilliant Snow Crow smiles as he plucks a few chords on his instrument, the notes suggesting the beginning of a battle charge.<br /> <br /> &quot;Pirates it seems. No ship would deliberately dress themselves in black.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13507-nicklance","name":"NickLance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13507_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-29T17:33:43-07:00","id":1109498,"title":"","content":"Instead of responding verbally, Hope just nods and gets out her mother.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-29T19:12:15-07:00","id":1109541,"title":"","content":"Brilliant Snow Crow frowns at a little girl holding out a knife, albeit a soulsteel knife, and wishing to fight. He had heard her life story, known that it was harsh and even girls like her have the skills to survive, something inside him does not sit right.<br /> <br /> &quot;Hope, would you not hide in the deck?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13507-nicklance","name":"NickLance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13507_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-30T04:47:42-07:00","id":1109698,"title":"","content":"Stunned by sudden awareness of the previously unseen ship, Mirrin leaps back from the ships rails to stand among the passengers and crew readying themselves for battle.<br /> <br /> Turning to the captain, Mirrin fights against a momentary hesitation before speaking...<br /> <br /> &quot;If anyone aboard has a bow or even a sling, I have some small knowledge of sorcery and could get them high above this ship to a better position to shoot from.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Visit me at <a href=\"http://www.bragrman.com\" target=\"_blank\"><i>Tales of Grey</i></a> - my RPG Game-Master's blog.<br /> <br /> &quot;If only I had an enemy bigger than my apathy, I could have won&quot; - <i>I gave you all,</i> Mumford &amp; Sons","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8520-capitantypo","name":"CapitanTypo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8520_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"896"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-30T06:59:04-07:00","id":1109738,"title":"","content":"Paxrae turns to address all aboard.&quot; It seems we'll be earning our commission for this voyage. All hands, prepare for a skirmish. If they mean to take the Gleaming Pearl, we'll intercept and either drive them off or board them first. Wait for my signal to attack, diplomacy may still be an option- they clearly aren't aware who they're dealing with.&quot; he adds with a smirk.<br /> <br /> To Hope: &quot;I appreciate your assistance in this matter. Stay close to Brilliant Snow Crow.&quot;<br /> <br /> To Brilliant Snow Crow: &quot;My charge is to see you safe to Haven sir. While I don't have the time or rank to debate with you on risking capture or injury, I do ask that you remain aboard the Mollusk until hostilities have subsided. You will be easier to protect surrounded by my crew.&quot;<br /> <br /> To Mirrin: &quot;Sorcery, eh? A valuable skill, any of my men that are willing are at your disposal. I'm afraid my knives are of little use aloft.&quot;<br /> <br /> Paxrae stretches and rolls his shoulders in anticipation of the task ahead.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3976-silent-witness","name":"Silent Witness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3976_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"138"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-30T08:11:38-07:00","id":1109765,"title":"","content":"Brilliant Snow Crow raises an eyebrow in amusement. &quot;Alright. I shall comply. Let us go Hope.&quot;<br /> <br /> Turning back to look at Paxrae he gives a confident smile. &quot;Naturally since only the Mollusk is the combat-worthy ship, I presume I will be brought into the thick of the action.&quot;<br /> <br /> In response to Paxrae's agreement, one bowman steps up to volunteer.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13507-nicklance","name":"NickLance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13507_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-30T15:50:32-07:00","id":1109953,"title":"","content":"Mr Fluffy wanders off into the various items that accumulate on a ships deck and disappears.<br /> <br /> Hope's Last Gasp, on the other hand, stays stubborn. &quot;I can help.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-30T16:05:19-07:00","id":1109958,"title":"","content":"Brilliant Snow Crow looks back as the stubborn little girl refuses to board the Mollusk and turns around to return to her. <br /> <br /> &quot;Captain, it looks like we are in a difficult situation. But seeing as I am also capable of contributing to the fight, let's say we just prepare ourselves to board them to take them down?&quot;<br /> <br /> Taking up his <i>sanxian</i> like a club, he gives it a few practice twirls as it spins gracefully in his hands, and the speed and movement of the instrument looks like they have considerable force behind them despite moving as if they were dancing in the air.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13507-nicklance","name":"NickLance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13507_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-30T16:59:11-07:00","id":1109969,"title":"","content":"In Mirrins nightmares there are chittering things that lurk in the shadows and dark places, waiting to devour any unwary traveller to step beyond the safety of the light. To those they see as kin, the creature's noises reveal secrets from the shadows, secretas that tell of twists of fate and essence. Each night Mirrin is forced to listen to these secrets, all the while helpless to save those who wander blindly into the maw of shadows. <br /> <br /> Nodding at paxraes man who steps forward, Mirrin now speaks some of the words heard whispered in nightmares, each word coalescing into a cloud of essence in the air about the small sorcerers frame. Small hands clutching at the essence-clouds, Mirrin weaves the small motes together to create a modest cloud platform that hovers just beyond the rail of the ship, suspended over the rippling water below.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Visit me at <a href=\"http://www.bragrman.com\" target=\"_blank\"><i>Tales of Grey</i></a> - my RPG Game-Master's blog.<br /> <br /> &quot;If only I had an enemy bigger than my apathy, I could have won&quot; - <i>I gave you all,</i> Mumford &amp; Sons","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8520-capitantypo","name":"CapitanTypo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8520_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"896"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-30T18:39:15-07:00","id":1109991,"title":"","content":"With the spell complete, Mirrin turns to Paxrae's archer, and urges him to grab enough arrows for the fight and jump aboard before leaping up to perch among the fluffy folds of the cloud, crouching low and peering above the egde of the cloud's swirling vapours. <br /> <br /> Once the archer is aboard, Mirrin makes a quick introduction with an outstretched hand, asking the warriors name before saying 'I hope you're not afraid of heights!&quot;<br /> <br /> With that the cloud lifts at Mirrin's mental command and drifts to a position away from the boat, several yards higher, using the ships sails to try and mask the cloud from the approaching black vessel.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Visit me at <a href=\"http://www.bragrman.com\" target=\"_blank\"><i>Tales of Grey</i></a> - my RPG Game-Master's blog.<br /> <br /> &quot;If only I had an enemy bigger than my apathy, I could have won&quot; - <i>I gave you all,</i> Mumford &amp; Sons","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8520-capitantypo","name":"CapitanTypo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8520_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"896"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-30T20:03:27-07:00","id":1110023,"title":"","content":"The ship, which is indeed painted black, is now clearly within sight and still approaching.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13507-nicklance","name":"NickLance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13507_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-01T13:55:19-07:00","id":1110343,"title":"","content":"The bowman introduces himself as Atabo as he pulls a longbow made from a single branch of sturdy wood from a waterproof sleeve along with a dozen or so arrows after stepping onto the Skiff with only mild trepidation. &quot;My first time standing on a cloud, is will be something to tell my grandchildren about.&quot;<br /> <br /> Paxrae turns to Hope and Briliant Snow Crow and speaks. &quot;I'll not tell anyone they can't fight to protect themselves. Just be careful and remember that surviving is our goal, anything else is secondary.&quot; To his crew; &quot;Get ready!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3976-silent-witness","name":"Silent Witness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3976_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"138"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-01T14:23:37-07:00","id":1110356,"title":"","content":"Hope nods seriously at Paxrae's statement.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-01T18:06:46-07:00","id":1110424,"title":"","content":"&quot;Brace yourselves everyone! We're going to cut off their advance; hopefully they'll recognize they're outmatched and head back out to sea.&quot; The Spry Mollusk picks up a sudden burst of speed and dashes in an unexpected course to intercept.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3976-silent-witness","name":"Silent Witness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3976_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"138"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-04T08:54:07-07:00","id":1111283,"title":"","content":"The black ship seems to ignore the Mollusk as it drives forward towards the Pearl as it nearly misses, prow meeting prow instead of the middle of the Pearl as all ramming maneuvers intend to.<br /> <br /> The massive crash causes a loud racket as wood meets wood, the huddled guests hiding below deck screamed in unison as the cruise ship rocks violently.<br /> <br /> The pirates however are determined to board whether they hit the prow or their intended section of the ship and come pouring out from their deck, a good two dozen charging onto the Gleaming Pearl.<br /> <br /> As the Spry Mollusk turns around to the side of the pirate ship, a dozen archers suddenly reveal themselves from the side of the pirate ship, drawing their bows and readying to fire.<br /> <br /> At the helm of the pirate ship stands two men, dressed more impressively than the pirates, and if appearances are important, would indicate that these two are the heads of this group.<br /> <br /> One of them has reddish-brown hair, golden eyes, wearing a black undershirt with the top half covered by a red, sleveless jacket along with white pants and a metal plated headband. He is of a muscular build, tall man with an elaborate great axe by his side.<br /> <br /> Another one has white hair, heterochromia (left green, right red) eyes, wearing a vibrant red sleeved jacket, a black shirt under it and baggy black pants. He seems leaner than the other man and carries a slashing sword at his side and a greatsword at his back.<br /> <br /> OOC: Join Battle, a Size 2 battlegroup has boarded the Pearl. a Size 1 battlegroup remains on the pirate ship. The two heads are on their ship and not moving yet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13507-nicklance","name":"NickLance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13507_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-04T15:46:40-07:00","id":1111432,"title":"","content":"As the group of pirates board, Hope's Last Gasp ducks behind a nearby crate, and uses the obstructions that accumulate on a ship to get into a good position.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-04T17:55:17-07:00","id":1111479,"title":"","content":"As the ships collide, Mirrin commands the cloud platform to draft swiftly around the vessels so that they are in the air somewhere to the sides of the attacking force, and crouches low, ready to deflect any incoming fire that may threaten Atabo...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Visit me at <a href=\"http://www.bragrman.com\" target=\"_blank\"><i>Tales of Grey</i></a> - my RPG Game-Master's blog.<br /> <br /> &quot;If only I had an enemy bigger than my apathy, I could have won&quot; - <i>I gave you all,</i> Mumford &amp; Sons","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8520-capitantypo","name":"CapitanTypo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8520_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"896"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-04T20:16:33-07:00","id":1111527,"title":"","content":"&quot;I'll give you and your crew one chance to lay down arms and leave in peace, otherwise be ready to face Paxrae the Storm Crow!&quot; Paxrae draws Tsunami's Apex.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3976-silent-witness","name":"Silent Witness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3976_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"138"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-05T03:30:16-07:00","id":1111600,"title":"","content":"Paxrae receives no response, but he could see in the eyes of the two pirate leaders that no quarter would be expected.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13507-nicklance","name":"NickLance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13507_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-05T15:34:38-07:00","id":1111842,"title":"","content":"As the boarding party comes on the deck their initially high spirits are dashed by a gurgle from one of their number, then then collapses. He has dead. As the realization of this ripples through the ranks, another falls. Now they are aware of danger, but cannot find it no matter how hard they look. They expect an adult, and their eyes are looking too high to see the child that is thinning their ranks.<br /> <br /> Hope's Last Gasp ghosts through the pirates, leaving some dead bodies, and a lot of lost morale in her wake. Quickly however she finds another hiding spot, too much motion means they will find her if she doesn't take care.<br /> <br /> (Hope is flurrying a decisive attack with an establish stealth action. She is spending one willpower, but no motes.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-05T16:02:47-07:00","id":1111861,"title":"","content":"After suddenly losing one man in their ranks and then several, the men spot the little girl with a dull blackish knife darting from their ranks. &quot;Over there!&quot; one of them shouts, pointing a sword in her direction.<br /> <br /> They have spotted her.<br /> <br /> But overhead a flare of bluish energy, whirling and whooshing like the wind erupts as Brilliant Snow Crow leaps out of the Mollusk and back onto the Pearl with his instrument clutched in his hand, something glitters beneath his sleeves as the swirling energies whirl around him, his expensive clothes billowing gracefully as he lands by stomping one of the raiding pirates onto the deck, despite the grace of his movements might indicate a soft landing the pirate is smushed into the boards, definitely dead.<br /> <br /> &quot;Now now, bullying a little girl? Get through me first.&quot; comes his confident response as the group surges backwards to get away from the elemental flux.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13507-nicklance","name":"NickLance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13507_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-05T19:15:58-07:00","id":1111937,"title":"","content":"The battle-hardened crew of the Spry Mollusk surges onto the deck of the opposing ship with startling efficiency and begins tearing into the archers before they can launch their first volley.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3976-silent-witness","name":"Silent Witness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3976_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"138"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-05T19:54:38-07:00","id":1111955,"title":"","content":"The archers yell out as the weapons smash into them, some of them prematurely firing their arrows into nowhere as they flinch or jerk away from the blows.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13507-nicklance","name":"NickLance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13507_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-06T18:23:59-07:00","id":1112442,"title":"","content":"To the Axe-wielding pirate.&quot;You've assaulted a ship bearing passengers headed in peace for Haven. Under Haven's authority and by my blade, you will be brought to justice.&quot; Paxrae advances with casual grace, bringing the black and gold blade of his daiklave into a fluid guard.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3976-silent-witness","name":"Silent Witness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3976_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"138"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-06T20:39:50-07:00","id":1112481,"title":"","content":"The axe-wielding pirate levels an unreadable gaze at the approaching daiklave as his eyes move up and down at the advancing Paxrae. A scrowl climbs up the corners of his mouth when he hears the second half of Paxrae's statement.<br /> <br /> &quot;You talk too much. Especially that justice bullshit.&quot; he grunts as he hefts his massive axe and brings it down in an expertly powerful swing.<br /> <br /> At this close combat range, Paxrae can see dark circles around the man's eyes, and a paler-than-natural hue to his skin, despite the fact that being on sea as pirates means facing the sun and getting tans.<br /> <br /> The sword pirate on the other hand, seems to have minute sparkles in his skin as is his white hair at this closeness seem slightly iridescent like mother of pearl.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":13507,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13507-nicklance","user":"NickLance","date":". 07-07-2017, 09:01 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13507-nicklance","name":"NickLance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13507_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-07T06:47:53-07:00","id":1112645,"title":"","content":"Paxrae sidesteps the deadly swing, seemingly in time with the rocking of the ship and delivers a lunge as he moves from beneath the path of the massive blade.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3976-silent-witness","name":"Silent Witness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3976_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"138"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}